      }
    },
    "Click OK next to each item" : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klicken Sie bei jedem Punkt auf „OK“"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click Open System Settings… below. It opens Privacy & Security → System & App Protection Override." : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klicken Sie unten auf „Systemeinstellungen öffnen …“. Damit öffnen Sie Datenschutz & Sicherheit → System & App Protection Override."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click Override System Protections" : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klicken Sie auf „Override System Protections“"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fertig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give KeyMinder Access" : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyMinder Zugriff geben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold ⌘ and click each app you want. To add every app in the folder, press ⌘A. Then click Add and enter your Mac password." : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halten Sie ⌘ gedrückt und klicken Sie auf jede gewünschte App. Mit ⌘A wählen Sie alle Apps im Ordner aus. Klicken Sie dann auf „Hinzufügen“ (Add) und geben Sie Ihr Mac-Passwort ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to give KeyMinder access" : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So geben Sie KeyMinder Zugriff"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeyMinder is in the Applications folder." : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyMinder finden Sie im Ordner „Programme“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeyMinder is now listed with “Control your entire Mac and all apps”. Its popup works in every app." : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyMinder steht jetzt mit „Control your entire Mac and all apps“ in der Liste. Das Popup funktioniert in jeder App."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeyMinder will then only work in the apps you add to its list." : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyMinder funktioniert dann nur in den Apps, die Sie zu seiner Liste hinzufügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks for your password each time you change an app to At Any Time. To skip this for every app, use All Apps instead." : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS fragt bei jeder App, die Sie auf „At Any Time“ stellen, nach Ihrem Passwort. Wenn Sie das nicht für jede App wollen, wählen Sie stattdessen „Alle Apps“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS lets you choose: KeyMinder can read all your apps, or only the apps you pick. Your data never leaves your Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sie haben die Wahl: KeyMinder darf alle Apps lesen oder nur die Apps, die Sie auswählen. Ihre Daten verlassen niemals Ihren Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS lists everything an app with this access could do. KeyMinder only reads the menus of the active app and runs a menu command when you click it." : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS listet alles auf, was eine App mit diesem Zugriff tun könnte. KeyMinder liest nur die Menüs der aktiven App und führt einen Menübefehl aus, wenn Sie darauf klicken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next Step" : {
      "comment" : "Permission guide for macOS 27.3+. Screenshots stay English; German only so far, other languages fall back to English.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false,
      "localizations" : {
